   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2015-03-24",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The member moved the Charter of Budget Honesty Amendment (Regional Australia Statements) Bill 2015, requiring the Treasurer to table Regional Australia Statements with each budget and Mid-Year Economic and Fiscal Outlook. The bill aims to ensure government policies assess their economic, social, cultural and environmental impacts on regional Australia, citing the 2014-15 budget's omission of such a statement and its disproportionate effects on areas like Wodonga, Wangaratta, Benalla and Alexandra."
  }
 ],
